#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "&konsole;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this module, you can configure basic settings for &konsole;, the &kde; "
"terminal. You can also easily create new schemata (appearance files) for "
"&konsole;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module contains several tab pages: <guilabel>General</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Schema</guilabel>, <guilabel>Session</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Write Daemon</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "General"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab page allows you to configure aspects of &konsole;'s functions. It "
"contains the following options:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use Konsole as default terminal application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you wish to have &kde; use another terminal application by default, "
"uncheck this box and enter the preferred application (<application>wterm</"
"application>, <application>rxvt</application>, &etc;) in the text field "
"below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Terminal Size when Resizing"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, &konsole; will show the size (in characters) of the window when "
"you are resizing, allowing you to make the window a specific size. Uncheck "
"this box to turn off this behavior."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Frame"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw an inner frame around the inside of the &konsole; window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Confirm quit with open sessions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When set, a warning appears when you try to close a &konsole; window with "
"multiple sessions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blinking Cursor"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have trouble spotting the cursor in the &konsole; window, you can "
"have it blink to draw your attention."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line Spacing"
msgstr "Espaciament de linhas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the space between lines of text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Consider the following characters part of a word when double clicking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is a common &UNIX; behavior to select a whole word when you double click "
"on it, however, the computer's idea of a word may differ from yours. Add "
"characters here that you would like to be considered always to be "
"<quote>part of a word</quote>. For example, adding the <literal>@</literal> "
"character will allow you to double click to select an entire email address."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schema"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Schema</guilabel> page will allow you to easily create, edit "
"and save schemata, with text and background coloring, transparency and "
"background images."
msgstr ""
